{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2015/01/05/8454532/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2015年\nあけましておめでとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"CDTVで年越し！\n初めて家族と年を越しませんでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2015/01/05/8454532/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年はだいすきなお洋服に\n芸術にお芝居に関わりたい。\n勉強したい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分にしか出せないものを\nもっと出していきたいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2015/01/05/8454532/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"感謝祭昼の部では\n1年ぶりにサンドアートを\n披露しました〜\nお客さんがいる前での\nパフォーマンスは初めてだったから\nほんとに緊張した..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてまりっか'17\n大感謝祭ということなので、\nサプライズ披露〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん喜んでくださって\n(た気がして)嬉しかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっか'17を歌ってる時の私は\nまりっかをやっているんだな\nって気になります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ピンクのヘッドホンに制服。\nゆるくてポップでヘンテコな世界。\nみんなのまりっかのイメージ\nなのかな、と。勝手に、\n普段の私のようで私じゃない。\n17歳の私でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのイメージもまた、\n変えていきたいなとも思ったり。\n18歳、2014年の\n私はどんな存在だったのかな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また何処かでまりっかが\n歌いに来るかもしれない！\nいつになるか、もうないのか、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その時はどうぞよろしく！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2015/01/05/8454532/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"年が明けてしばらくは\n家族と過ごしています。\nおばあちゃんに会ったり、\n久しぶりに大阪に住んでた時代の\n幼馴染に会ったり！\n年明けの買い物は楽しい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2015/01/05/8454532/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろんな人に出会いたい\nいろんなことを記憶したい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は人々の記憶に残るのか\n何をすれば残るのか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2015/01/05/8454532/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"キ   オ       ク"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2015/01/05/8454532/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"き"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"く"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2015/01/05/8454532/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"知らない場所に行って\nたくさん吸収して\n好きなことが繋がりますように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2015/01/05/8454532/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}